<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>bensbites newsletter</title><link>https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/aZEO13FmoqtHnU2CXKZvoF1xxobEeaXd.xml</link><description>Messages from sources matching bensbites@substack.com</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 06 May 2026 15:42:18 GMT</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/aZEO13FmoqtHnU2CXKZvoF1xxobEeaXd.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"></atom:link><item><title>Codex is gaining steam</title><link>https://rss.longlone.de5.net/own/aZEO13FmoqtHnU2CXKZvoF1xxobEeaXd.xml#item-22</link><guid isPermaLink="false">own-newsletter:item:22</guid><pubDate>Tue, 05 May 2026 13:02:54 GMT</pubDate><author>ben's bites &lt;bensbites@substack.com&gt;</author><description>Codex is gaining steambut I wish it had this͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏ ­͏...</description><content:encoded>Codex is gaining steam&lt;img src="https://eotrx.substackcdn.com/o/0b495092f9fdb164/p.gif?token=eyJtIjoiPDIwMjYwNTA1MTMwMjU0LjMuN2UwMGI3MGYzOGIwZDNjM0BtZy1kMC5zdWJzdGFjay5jb20-IiwidSI6NTAwOTEzNDY2LCJyIjoia29iNjIyOTE0MDRAMTYzLmNvbSIsImQiOiJtZy1kMC5zdWJzdGFjay5jb20iLCJwIjoxOTY1MDgyODQsInQiOiJuZXdzbGV0dGVyIiwiYSI6ImV2ZXJ5b25lIiwicyI6NDM3OTI5OSwiYyI6InBvc3QiLCJmIjp0cnVlLCJwb3NpdGlvbiI6InRvcCIsImlhdCI6MTc3Nzk4NjUzOSwiZXhwIjoxNzgwNTc4NTM5LCJpc3MiOiJwdWItMCIsInN1YiI6ImVvIn0.mRXAebdZntLey6JeblId_j2vhpdB5gPVJahZXH2gIyA" alt="" width="1" height="1"&gt;but I wish it had this͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &amp;nbsp;   ­͏ &